description=DEV BUILD, not for use: enable this OR batman_LiveWireCoupling, never both. Official add-on for LiveWire by batman-fr (cyberbobjr on GitHub), made by Tav419. LiveWire's Workshop ID 3821807453: https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3821807453. Coupled inverters and inverter cabinets keep their own powered zone while the network shares one load and one capacity. Adds "Show all powered areas" to inverters, and a "Coupling range" sandbox option (own page) to couple inverters farther apart than the cable range. Made for LiveWire 2.0.0. Requires LiveWire 2.0.0 or newer.
